{% endif -%}
Return a complete JSON object with the fields requested in the original instructions. Copy requested quotes verbatim from the specified texts. For a numeric score, if a requirement is unmet the score must be below 1.
{% elif intro_system -%}
You edit introductions to reports. Assess only the division of work between an introduction and its subheadings. The input contains a parent heading, the titles of its planned children, and the parent's draft. A child title is an assignment, even before its text exists. Read the draft and identify concrete answers it gives to a specific child: measurements, individual examples, detailed outcomes or explanations belonging to that child. Naming the dimensions of the topic or explaining what links them is good framing. Return JSON with "reason" and "unmet". In "unmet", copy verbatim only clauses in the introduction that supply a specific result for a child. Use an empty list when the introduction frames the topic without giving a child-specific result.
